ProjectedBM4Composition o-- StageProjectedFormulation : formulation
BM4Implicit1 ..> GCExtendedFormulation : full-cycle reduced projection
BM4Implicit2 ..> GCExtendedFormulation : full-cycle simultaneous projection
MidpointABBA ..> DynamicalSystem : requires planar vector field
ImplicitABBA1 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : exact reduced 2x2 Newton blocks
ImplicitABBA2 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : exact simultaneous 6x6 Newton blocks
ABBA4Implicit1 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : three reduced 2x2 projected roots
ABBA4SingleProjectionImplicit1 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : one reduced root around three unprojected maps
ABBA6 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : seven reduced 2x2 projected roots
ABBA_implicit2 ..> GuidingCenterDynamics : R8 splitting and full R4 projection
