ImplicitABBA6IntegrationStep o-- "7" ImplicitABBAIntegrationStep : ordered signed roots
ABBA4SingleProjectionIntegrationStep o-- "3" UnprojectedABBAIntegrationStep : continuous signed base maps
IntegrationStage --> DynamicalSystem : exposes exact generating instance
IntegrationStep --> DynamicalSystem : exposes exact generating instance

  class Solution {
    + source: InitialConfiguration
    + t: Array
    + states: Array
    + diagnostics: read-only Mapping
    + components(): Components
    + positions(): (Array, Array)
  }
}

SimulationRunner ..> InitialValueProblem
SimulationRunner ..> NumericalMethod
SimulationRunner ..> SimulationRequest
