  class TenMethodTrajectoryComparisonStudy {
    + two midpoint and eight implicit variants
    + same initial configuration and saved-time grid
    + complete step independent from aligned save interval
    + 45 periodic-distance and ten runtime summaries
    + eight aligned nonlinear-work series
  }
  class HighPrecisionReferenceStudy {
    + DOP853 reference on prescribed saved times
    + independent Radau resolution audit
    + actual interpolated-dynamics fingerprint
    + declared periodic or Euclidean distance convention
