    + reference-declared errors and resolved observed-order deficits
    + Newton work, normalized residual/tangent ABBA-map work, and multiplier scaling
    + median runtime and interquartile timing interval
  }
  class ABBA6AccuracyStudy {
    + validates the versioned reference identity and checksum
    + one ABBA6 trajectory per nested complete step
    + reference-declared RMS errors, refinement gains, and observed orders
    + nonlinear work, runtime, and reference-floor resolution
  }
  class ImplicitABBAJacobianParticleStepSeries {
