  class GCFullyExtendedSymplecticityObserver {
    + analytic cross-coupled Omega8 base-map defects
    + analytic complete projected Omega4 map defects
    + centered D Psi / D R / D Phi audits
    + determinant and conditioning checks
  }
  class ParticleJacobianAnalysis {
    + trace, determinant, discriminant
    + eigensystem and singular system
